OL,3,APhones to be banned from pupils' bags
OL,4,Aor pockets under stricter rules for
OL,5,Aschools in England
OL,6,
OL,7,FPupils will not be allowed access to
OL,8,Ftheir phones at all during the school
OL,9,Fday under stricter government guidance
OL,10,Fin England.
OL,12,FStatutory guidance came into force in
OL,13,FJune, making schools and trusts legally
OL,14,Fresponsible for being phone-free
OL,15,Fthroughout the day.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
